                "description": "The Hera Mortise Handleset has a sleek look that makes it perfect for modern homes. The contemporary feel of this mortise front door lock is accentuated through its strong lines. Emtek's Hera Mortise Entrance Handleset is available in both dummy and single cylinder functions. The single cylinder ANSI F20 mortise box can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. The Hera Mortise Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. This exterior door mortise-lockset is available in a huge selection of knobs and levers to choose from for the interior trim.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Hera Mortise Entrance Handlesets, Hera Mortise Handlesets, EMT-3345, Emtek 3345, Emtek 3045, Emtek Hera Mortise Entrance Handlesets, Hera Mortise Entrance Handlesets, single cylinder entry sets, modern handlesets, contemporary handlesets, modern front door handles, contemporary front door handles, exterior door mortise-locksets, exterior door mortise locksets, mortise-lock keyed entry door handlesets, mortise door handle replacements,\r\nentry door hardware, EMT-F20-3345"
